# The answer (0.6, call and response): Answer on (System), a phrase on the lead, a beat's rest, and StoryBox plays it
# back changed; a key while it answers stops it
wait 300
listen
tap GLO
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
spin K4 1
wait 100
said ANSWER ON
expect answered 0
tap EDIT
wait 100
key 7 down
wait 250
key 7 up
key 9 down
wait 250
key 9 up
key 11 down
wait 250
key 11 up
key 14 down
wait 500
key 14 up
wait 1500
shot answer.png
wait 2500
expect answered 8
# again: a key cuts it short
key 12 down
wait 200
key 12 up
key 16 down
wait 200
key 16 up
wait 1000
key 7 down
wait 100
key 7 up
wait 2000
# off: nothing answers
tap GLO
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
expect view 11
expect answer 1
spin K4 -1
wait 100
expect answer 0
said ANSWER OFF
